  "annotation_rules": [
    "Only annotate visible object extent; clip boxes at the image edge. Preserve truncated flags.",
    "Do not infer electric utility use from an unidentified pole. Keep pole when function is uncertain.",
    "Tree is the visible whole; tree_trunk is the visible trunk. They are distinct overlapping targets.",
    "Traffic signal pole is separate from the lamp head. Never infer red/green state from an object prompt.",
    "All automatic predictions are pseudo_label_unreviewed, including empty files. Empty predictions are not verified negatives.",
    "Single-route frames are training data only. No random frame train/test split and no independent accuracy claim.",
    "No synthetic boxes for absent or uncertain classes. Class vocabulary inclusion does not establish training coverage.",
    "Exposed pipes/fire department connections are pipe, not freestanding fire hydrants; preserve visibly separate instances.",
    "Small planters include their contained small plant; raised masonry tree planters use the visible container extent, with tree/tree_trunk separately annotated. Flush tree pits are not planters or open manholes.",
    "Bush/hedge is distinct from a tree with a visible trunk. Use visible connected hedge extent; do not label foliage as a pole or building column."
  ]
